{"version":1,"content":"<p>Linux內核開發社區近日發生一起引發廣泛關注的安全事件。安全研究人員原本應通過私密渠道提交的多個尚未修復的Linux內核漏洞報告，因操作失誤被發送到了公開的Linux內核郵件列表（LKML），導致相關漏洞信息提前曝光。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583486.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T05:43:51.773155+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":115,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T05:34:58+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T05:38:06.572122+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T05:38:06.572122+00:00","content_hash":"1085aee63e2e5e9ffe59651b9cb6c134dd4e4e36ec34de5fc34faa5616fcdbfb","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}